/** @mainpage KatanaDataProvider Module

    @tableofcontents

    @section katanadataproviderintro KatanaDataProvider Introduction

    The %KatanaDataProvider module provides a data provider API for Katana MRP, a cloud-based
    manufacturing and inventory management platform.

    To use this module, use \c "%requires KatanaDataProvider" in your code.

    All the public symbols in the module are defined in the KatanaDataProvider namespace.

    @section katanadataproviderrelnotes Release Notes

    @subsection katanadataproviderv1_0 KatanaDataProvider v1.0
    - the initial version of the %KatanaDataProvider module
*/
